{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Don't worry about it. Bigger things to be concerned about.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T16:38:41.658000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869982207089987584","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...and who's the reason why I can be concerned about the bigger things in the first place?'","created_at":"2021-07-28T16:38:58.776000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869982278888087632","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'I'd probably have gone mad weeks ago without your help. And it would be a poor repayment to not help you when you need it.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T16:40:00.859000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869982539283038269","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I've done my job then.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T16:47:12.997000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869984351801188442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
