{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Everyone alright there, then?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T16:58:32.817000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869987203172950066","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Looks like it - ah, turns out Eliza's at the Lamplighter's place, and so is Mender, so he'll be more help than me anyway.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T16:59:12.841000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869987371045757018","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Ah. I see. Can you please pass to Mender that I'm sorry he had to come there? And to Eliza and Vivica that I'm sorry about the berries earlier.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:00:45.983000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869987761711628398","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...I can do that. But that still sounds worrying.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:01:16.449000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869987889495281695","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I'm just finding my place in the city.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:01:35.764000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869987970508267521","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Alright, Kukudh says that Mender says, and I quote, \"He is fine.... I havent seen Kingsbridge yet.... I had things here I needed to do for personal reasons\"... does that help at all?'","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:05:18.040000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869988902801379388","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'And now they've gone to get Vivica over to there, so I guess I'm not needed now.' she shrugs.","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:08:32.168000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869989717033226242","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Roy shrugs. \"Welcome to the club, I suppose. I hope you won't be in it for too long.\" He drops onto the grass with hands behind his head.","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:11:05.051000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869990358271004763","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...is that what the problem is?'","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:12:46.391000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869990783321788487","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Because honestly, I was worried about that to the point I planned to ask Mender if it meant I was doing something wrong... Eliza and Vivica are more important than me here, though.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:14:07.405000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869991123119128606","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she lets out a soundless laugh. 'You got secrets entrusted, at least. I'm guessing it's related somehow, so I'm not going to ask about what you meant by the apology, but.' she shrugs and flops down next to him.","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:16:29.667000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869991719809208330","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"So I'll do the most useful thing and stay out of the way for now.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:18:56.963000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869992337613393990","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Fine, then I'll do the most useful thing and take on the role of comforter I was assigned and stay with you.'","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:20:14.135000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869992661296242698","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Since when are you assigned that and by whom?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:20:49.140000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869992808117841952","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Well, Mender said to Kukudh that I should stay around for when people woke up, but now they've ended up going to Mender which is what I was planning to suggest in the first place, so...'","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:22:29.888000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869993230685573170","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Honestly, I'm worried. He said I could feel the path, but... if I can, why am I not sure what to do?'","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:23:04.889000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869993377490415626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Roy shrugs. \"I might just be a bad influence, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:24:00.907000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869993612446953545","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she sits up and stares at him. 'Because clearly you're a worse influence than I was when I was literally a zombie with a ***Thing*** in my brain. Checks out. For the record, that was sarcasm.' she sounds a lot less composed than normal.","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:25:51.217000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869994075120607282","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'You say I've changed for the better, yes?'","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:27:18.814000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869994442529079367","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Yep, you had that strength this whole time.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T17:28:49.779000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869994824063930368","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
